    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ask the Repo\nA chat bot that answers questions about the Ask the Room codebase.\n\nEach message: load `CONTEXT.md` from GitHub (always fresh from `main`) \u2192 Claude answers, opening files, listing folders and reading commits as needed.\n\nKeep `CONTEXT.md` up to date and the bot stays up to date with it. No re-import needed.",
        "height": 272,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -464,
        -96
      ],
      "id": "6b1e7b39-03fb-5272-9d4f-aed6d1fe9399",
      "name": "About"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (5 min)\n1. **Anthropic** credential: API key from console.anthropic.com. Select it on *Claude Sonnet 5*.\n2. **GitHub API** credential: fine-grained token with *Contents: read* + *Metadata: read* on `anshulk08/asktheroom` (the repo is private). Select it on *Load CONTEXT.md* and the three tools.\n3. Save, then **Publish/Activate**.\n4. Open the chat trigger and copy the **public chat URL**. Share it with the team.",
        "height": 304,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 6
      },
